<title>JAPAN: Tachi-s -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tachi-s -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 30.92		vs	   33.33</p>
<p> Operating	  486    million	  vs	  466    million</p>
<p> Current	    634    million	  vs	  589    million</p>
<p> Net		  315    million	  vs	  565    million</p>
<p> EPS		   12.53 yen	  vs	   23.28 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     26 million	  vs	  24 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tachi-s Co Ltd is a comprehensive automobile seat manufacturer.</p>
